SEP 1.4.1 C library sources with local correctness fixes.
Upstream: https://github.com/sep-developers/sep
Commit: 4c3acca6ce357d74b050cb46481af00c0bc96e32
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later; see the source headers and LICENSE files.
Configure STELLASTACK_SYSTEM_SEP=ON to use a distribution SEP package instead.

Local patch: stellastack-fixes.patch. Pixel-list stride is rounded to the
record alignment, offsetof replaces null-pointer member arithmetic, and duplicate
cflux/flux allocations are removed. Detected with UBSan/LeakSanitizer.
Distribution SEP builds are maintained independently and may need these fixes.
